{
	"from": "RFC kd7f9: resource, own, borrow, include and a use or import of another package refused as the WIT is read, and anything else of WIT.md the subset does not take, each where it is; RFC vr5lw: an option within an option. Each file is its lines joined by a newline, a newline ending it; a line and a column count from 1, a column in code points. Every refusal is named in the order of where it is, and a token out of place ends the reading",
